Hello, everyone.
大家好。

197
00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.020
Today, we are going to be talking about the fight.
今天，我们要讨论的是《打架》那一集。

198
00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.160
The Fight.
《打架》。

199
00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:38.820
The Fight.
《打架》。

