很抱歉打破你的幻想。

996
00:40:11.490 --> 00:40:12.870
I might come in someday with a liSt.
也许哪天我会带着清单过来。

997
00:40:13.310 --> 00:40:14.610
I think that's fantastic.
我觉得那太棒了。

998
00:40:14.690 --> 00:40:15.910
What is your time code?
你的时间码是多少？

999
00:40:15.990 --> 00:40:17.290
Well, I was very excited.
嗯，我当时非常兴奋。

1000
00:40:17.430 --> 00:40:25.110
It's 11 minutes, 50 seconds, and it is the scene where Pam and Jim are walking to the
是11分50秒，那是帕姆和吉姆走去

